PLACEHOLDER - not the real linker.

The real Linux-hosted `lld-link` (LLVM PE/COFF linker) belongs next to this
file as `bin/windows-cross/lld-link` (no extension, executable). The prebuilt
binary is not stored in the repository.

To provision it, follow "How to (re)provision the binary" in README.md, then
delete this placeholder.

Expected after provisioning:
    bin/windows-cross/lld-link            (executable, +x)
    bin/windows-cross/LICENSE.TXT
    bin/windows-cross/README.md
